Leagues V begins on November 27th!

To make the wait a little more bearable, we'll be dropping a surprise reveal about the League every day until just before launch, and gathering them all here in one handy newspost.

We’ve also included a quick FAQ that we’ll keep updated over the next couple of weeks, and a survey where you can drop those all-important questions.

If you’re wondering what on earth a League is, you might want to check out our Summer Summit blog [https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/leagues-v-raging-echoes---summer-summit-2024?oldschool=1 here]. You can also spot all the themed rewards from Leagues V: Raging Echoes [https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/a=13/leagues-v-raging-echoes---rewards?oldschool=1 here]!

