==November 22nd: All Relic Passives==
While Relics are plenty powerful enough in their own right, it's the passives unlocked with each tier that take your Leagues progression to the next level!

For a ''full'' breakdown of every single Relic passive, check out this graphic below. If you're only interested in what's fresh this League or has been moved around, scroll a little further down.

[[File:Leagues V Teasers & FAQs - Releasing November 27th (28).png|thumb|600px|center|If you can't see the image above, click [https://cdn.runescape.com/assets/img/external/oldschool/2024/newsposts/2024-11-22-587gt3/012-relic-passives.jpg here]!]]

Here are all of the headline changes to Relic passives. It's time to start planning out those routes, and this time around: you'll have more choice than ever!
* 5x Drop Rate multiplier now unlocks alongside your Tier 4 Relic, down from Tier 8.
** Additionally, this multiplier will apply to Twisted Ancestral Colour Kits, Holy Ornament Kits, Sanguine Ornament Kit, and Awakener's Orbs.
* Unlocking your Tier 3 Relic will grant double Combat XP (including Prayer and Hitpoints) on top of the global XP Multiplier, plus the Bigger and Badder Slayer unlock, 5x Slayer points and a 1 in 50 Superior spawn rate.
* Minigame enjoyers will want to blast to Tier 4 to unlock 5x Minigame Reward rates.
** This time around, this rate increase is also applied to Marks of Grace, Hallowed Marks, Brimhaven Vouchers ''and'' Stardust!
* Right off the bat at Tier 1, you'll enjoy Farming cycles that are five times faster than the main game, and every Clue Scroll you receive (including Clue Geodes, Clues in a Bottle and Clue Nests) will drop as a stackable Clue box.

